---
import BaseHead from '../components/BaseHead.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import { AUTHOR_GITHUB,SITE_TITLE } from '../consts';
---
<!doctype html><html lang="zh-CN"><head><BaseHead title={`关于 · ${SITE_TITLE}`} description="一梦未醒的个人技术实验室"/></head><body><Header/><main>
<article class="about pixel-shell reveal">
	<div class="scene"><img src="/pixel-lab/lab-hero.webp" alt="实验室里的像素维护机器人" width="1672" height="941"/><div class="scanner"></div><small>MAINTENANCE UNIT / ACTIVE</small></div>
	<div class="about-copy"><span class="eyebrow">OPERATOR FILE</span><h1>这里是<br/><em>一梦未醒</em>。</h1><p class="lead">一间用来拆解问题、保存经验、偶尔捕捉灵感的个人技术实验室。</p><p>文章是实验日志，标签是信号频段，代码则是仍在运转的设备。这里不承诺标准答案，只记录问题如何被发现、验证和重新理解。</p><p>如果某枚数据卡带帮你缩短了一次排错，或者引出了一个新问题，这次信号交换就已经值得。</p><div class="actions"><a class="button-link" href="/blog/">进入档案库 →</a><a class="github" href={AUTHOR_GITHUB} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">CODE / REDHEADFEATHER ↗</a></div>
	<div class="specs"><span><b>FORMAT</b>MARKDOWN</span><span><b>ENGINE</b>ASTRO</span><span><b>STATUS</b>WRITING</span></div></div>
</article>
</main><Footer/></body></html>
<style>
.about{display:grid;grid-template-columns:.9fr 1.15fr;gap:clamp(2rem,7vw,6rem);margin-top:4rem;padding:clamp(1.4rem,4vw,3rem);background:#e2c594}.scene{position:relative;min-height:590px;overflow:hidden;border:4px solid var(--line);background:#1b0f0c;box-shadow:inset 8px 8px #0d0706}.scene img{position:absolute;inset:0;width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;object-position:76% center;image-rendering:pixelated;transform:scale(1.35);filter:saturate(.85) contrast(1.08)}.scene::after{content:'';position:absolute;inset:0;background:repeating-linear-gradient(0deg,transparent 0 4px,#0004 5px);pointer-events:none}.scene small{position:absolute;z-index:2;left:1rem;bottom:1rem;padding:.35rem .55rem;color:#ffb478;background:#21120f;border:2px solid #74402f;font-family:var(--display);font-size:.54rem}.scanner{position:absolute;z-index:2;left:0;right:0;top:20%;height:3px;background:#ff6d3b;box-shadow:0 0 18px 5px #ff5e39;animation:scan 4s steps(24) infinite}.about-copy{padding:2rem 0}.about-copy h1{margin:.5rem 0 1.5rem;font-size:clamp(2.8rem,6vw,5.4rem);line-height:1.05}.about-copy h1 em{color:var(--hot);font-style:normal}.about-copy p{max-width:630px;color:#684230}.about-copy .lead{color:var(--ink);font-size:1.2rem}.actions{display:flex;align-items:center;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:1.5rem;margin:2rem 0}.github{color:#177c76;font-family:var(--display);font-size:.6rem;text-decoration:none}.specs{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:.6rem;margin-top:2.5rem}.specs span{padding:.7rem;color:#ffd0a3;background:#2a1713;border:3px solid #5e3327;font-family:var(--display);font-size:.55rem}.specs b{display:block;color:var(--acid);font-weight:400}@keyframes scan{0%{top:10%}50%{top:88%}100%{top:10%}}
@media(max-width:800px){.about{grid-template-columns:1fr;margin-top:2rem}.scene{min-height:420px}.about-copy{padding:.5rem}.specs{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
</style>
